---
import Layout from '@layouts/Page.astro';
import LinkList from '@components/LinkList.astro';
import { travelTrips } from '@links/registry';
---
<Layout title="San Francisco 2026">
  <LinkList slot="sidebar" items={travelTrips} orientation="vertical" />
<p>
This year I'm exploring San Francisco with my mentor, Imani, a PsyD student at Stanford. San Francisco is the big city closest to home, but I've mostly seen it the way a tourist does. Our goal is for me to know it like a local, as my own city. Every other week we pick a different neighborhood or experience and spend the day there.
</p>

<p>
Our first outing, on September 6, was to Haight-Ashbury, the neighborhood famous for the 1960s counterculture. We went thrifting in its vintage clothing stores and spent time at Amoeba Music, a huge record store.
</p>

<p>
On September 26 we walked Valencia Street in the Mission. We stopped at Paxton Gate and the International Children’s Library, and did a lot of window shopping along the way.
</p>

<p>
On October 17 we explored North Beach, San Francisco’s old Italian neighborhood.
</p>
</Layout>
